{"axis": "code", "model": "EFDC", "path": "EFDC/raw/source_code/EFDCPlus_Stable/EFDC/mod_netcdf.f90", "sha256": "dbf9473abaa44745b6a1bd1b4892ee025d0a813f8cbc8d19176343c9f6ea16bf", "bytes": 106884, "lines_or_pages": 2120, "read_status": "complete", "read_range": "1-2120", "reader": "anthropic/claude-fable-5", "read_at": "2026-08-25T00:26:37Z", "artifact_class": "semantic_read", "producer": "llm:anthropic/claude-fable-5", "read_method": "llm_full_read", "comprehension_status": "complete", "source_sha256": "dbf9473abaa44745b6a1bd1b4892ee025d0a813f8cbc8d19176343c9f6ea16bf", "chunk_manifest_sha256": "a7fdddae57452451a28b70edbc67621dd8e0300373fef76f294bf7a2d4a7532d", "prompt_sha256": "13b91717e70bf4f9a21debb94a80bf6e91de480e419fc04e843d050086574153", "run_id": "reread20260728-code-EFDC-000-fable5-20260813T012841Z-5799640f", "auditor": "llm:openai/codex", "audit_seed": "6465d0b8bd3f7acb9a2a437da66cfb37e1a0f0a8033b44214f49f1907e393ae6", "audit_status": "pending", "content": {"what_it_is": "EFDC+ NetCDF UGRID output module (module mod_netcdf @L11, '! Write NetCDF UGrid format' @L9, author line 2021-01-18 Nghiem Tien Lam @L10). It holds a 155-entry output-variable catalog (define_nc_vars @L94-L261, nc_var rows list id/short name/units/data_type/dim_type/layer dim/component dim/long_name/CF standard_name), an option-driven output mask setter (set_nc_flags @L263-L301 zeroes IS_NC_OUT entries from ISWAVE/NWSER/NASER/IEVAP/ISGWIE/NQCTL/NQWR/NQJPIJ/NPD/ISTRAN/ISICE/NDYE/ICALC_BL/ISTRWQ/NALGAE/NZOOPL/ISRPEM/ISFFARM/IWQBEN/ISSDBIN; both call sites commented @L599/@L773). nc_create_file (@L303-L689) builds the spatial file: NF90_CREATE with NF90_CLOBBER+NF90_NETCDF4 @L316; counts cells/cols/rows from LA_Global/IMX-IMN/JMX-JMN @L329-L331; averages cell corner coordinates XCR/YCR into shared nodes (@L346-L367) via readcorn/utmpars (@L339-L340), optionally converting UTM to WGS84 with utmr_wgs84 when ISWGS84 == 0 and UTMZ /= 0 (@L375-L378); numbers nodes (@L369-L388), builds face-node connectivity nv (@L402-L426); defines dims (@L432-L453), CRS + UGRID mesh variables with CF attributes (@L458-L596), global attributes Conventions CF-1.11/UGRID-1.0, base_date, Project, utm_zone, institution DSI LLC (@L602-L612); writes mesh arrays (@L617-L626); writes vertical coordinate either per-cell sigma-zed (IGRIDV > 0, KSZ_Global/DZC @L631-L652) or 1-D sigma from DZCK (@L653-L663); writes CUV rotation (@L665-L672), RSSBC edge weights (@L674-L680), SEDDIA (@L682-L684). nc_create_hf_file (@L691-L827) builds a high-frequency station file for subset is with NPNT(IS) locations, coordinates from HFREGRP(IS).XCEL/YCEL or ICEL/JCEL via LIJ_Global (@L793-L814), station names (@L821-L824). def_time_vars (@L829-L989) defines the time variable (units 'days since' base date, julian calendar, MJD format @L838-L845) and conditionally defines catalog vars per IS_NC_OUT/ISSPH/LSEDZLJ/ISBEXP/NQCTLSER/NQCTRULES flags. def_var (@L992-L1067) maps dim_type 1-8 onto dimension tuples (time / cell / cell+time / cell+layer+time / cell+comp+time / cell+layer+comp+time / comp+time / layer+comp+time), sets deflate level deflev, CF attributes, mesh/location/grid_mapping for types 2-6, and _FillValue ZERO or MISSING_VALUE. Write helpers (@L1125-L1444) copy global arrays into scaled real(4) buffers - cell (surface), wc (water column, bottom-layer-aware via KSZ_Global), bed (KBT_Global-limited) in 1d/2d/3d variants - and nf90_put_var them at nc.time_idx. nc_write (@L1446-L2043) advances time_idx, writes time and DELT, then every enabled field group: Zb/HP/WSEL, velocity rotated by CUE/CVE/CUN/CVN when ROTA == 1, shear stresses, waves, salinity/temperature, dye, toxics, sediment (both SEDZLJ TSED/BULKDENS/PERSED/D50AVG/CBL path @L1624-L1712 and original SEDB/SNDB path @L1713-L1744), 19 WQ variables + algae + zooplankton slices of WQV_Global, sediment diagenesis vars 78-116, RPEM 117-120, shellfish farm 132-154 from SF(i) members, hydraulic structures from QCTLT and HSCTL_GL(i).CUR members, withdrawal/return from WITH_RET_CTL, winds and pressure. Only master process writes (process_id /= master_id return @L1457/@L2052/@L2100). nc_output (@L2045-L2090) manages the model-wide file: single-file mode issglfil == 1 reopens/creates .//#output//efdc_out.nc; daily mode issglfil == 0 stamps filename with togregor datestamp and rolls files, honoring tendncdf. nc_output_hf (@L2092-L2118) does the same per subset file OUTDIR//efdc_hf_NNN.nc. end module @L2120.", "entities": ["module mod_netcdf @L11 (end module @L2120)", "use GLOBAL @L14; use julianmod @L15; use hydstrucmod @L16; use Variables_WQ @L17; use shellfishmod @L18; use fields @L19; use cyclone @L20; use convertwgs84 @L21; use netcdf @L22; use Variables_MPI @L23; use Variables_MPI_Mapping @L24; use Variables_MPI_Write_Out @L25; use Variables_MPI_Drifter @L26; use Mod_Map_Write_NetCDF @L27", "implicit none @L29", "type nc_var @L34-L45: id @L35, name @L36, units @L37, data_type @L38, dim_type @L39, layer_dim @L40, comp_dim @L41, long_name @L42, standard_name @L43, idx(:) allocatable @L44", "type nc_dataset @L47-L86: id @L48, isopen @L49, node_dim @L50, col_dim @L51, row_dim @L52, lcm_dim @L53, cnr_dim @L54, nodecnt @L55, cellcnt @L56, colcnt @L57, rowcnt @L58, nc_msh(9) @L59, nc_sig @L60, nc_kl @L61, nc_kc @L62, nc_lyr @L63, nc_cuv @L64, nc_rssbc @L65, nc_seddia @L66, cell_dim @L67, time_dim @L68, name_dim @L69, kc_dim @L70, dye_dim @L71, tox_dim @L72, nalg_dim @L73, nzoo_dim @L74, nshf_dim @L75, kb_dim @L76, sed_dim @L77, snd_dim @L78, sxd_dim @L79, nseds2_dim @L80, nqctl_dim @L81, nqwr_dim @L82, time_idx @L83, nc_time @L84, idx(NC_VAR_CNT) @L85", "type(nc_dataset),allocatable :: nc(:) @L89", "character(10) :: nc_datestamp @L90", "function define_nc_vars(nc) result(ncvar) @L94-L261 (155-entry nc_var catalog assignment @L98-L260)", "subroutine set_nc_flags @L263-L301", "function nc_create_file(filename) result(nc) @L303-L689", "function nc_create_hf_file(is,filename) result(nc) @L691-L827", "subroutine def_time_vars(nc, ix, ncvar) @L829-L989", "subroutine def_var(nc, ncvar, i) @L992-L1067", "integer function nc_open_file(nc_id, filename) @L1069-L1078", "subroutine nc_close_file(nc_id) @L1080-L1089", "integer function check_err(status,msg) @L1091-L1099", "subroutine readcorn @L1101-L1122 (use infomod,only:readstr @L1103)", "integer function nc_write_array1d(nc, id, array1d, offset, count, factor, msg) @L1125-L1149", "integer function nc_write_cell_1d(nc, is, ix, array1d, factor, msg) @L1152-L1185", "integer function nc_write_cell_2d(nc, is, ix, array2d, nk, factor, msg) @L1187-L1224", "integer function nc_write_wc_2d(nc, is, ix, array2d, nk, factor, msg) @L1226-L1266", "integer function nc_write_wc_3d(nc, is, ix, array3d, nk, ncmp, factor, msg) @L1268-L1313", "integer function nc_write_bed_2d(nc, is, ix, array2d, factor, msg) @L1315-L1354", "integer function nc_write_bed_3d(nc, is, ix, array3d, ncmp, factor, msg) @L1356-L1399", "integer function nc_write_cell_3d(nc, is, ix, array3d, nk, ncmp, factor, msg) @L1401-L1444", "subroutine nc_write(nc, is, timesec) @L1446-L2043", "subroutine nc_output() @L2045-L2090", "subroutine nc_output_hf(ncal,is) @L2092-L2118"], "constants": [{"name": "ZERO", "value": "0", "line": 31}, {"name": "ONE", "value": "1", "line": 31}, {"name": "FOUR", "value": "4", "line": 31}, {"name": "NC_VAR_CNT", "value": "155", "line": 31}, {"name": "LEN_NAME", "value": "20", "line": 31}, {"name": "MISSING_VALUE", "value": "-999.", "line": 32}], "params_defined": [], "equations": [{"expr": "xm(1) = xc(r,c) / num(r,c)", "ref": "node coordinate = average of accumulated cell-corner coordinates", "loc": 373}, {"expr": "lonc(k) = lonc(k) / m", "ref": "face centroid = mean of its 4 node longitudes", "loc": 422}, {"expr": "kcsgz(L-1) = KC - k1 + 1", "ref": "number of active vertical layers per cell (sigma-zed), k1 = KSZ_Global(L) @L639", "loc": 640}, {"expr": "dzsgz(k,L-1) = (sumdzc - 0.5*DZC(L,K))", "ref": "sigma value at layer midpoint (cumulative DZC minus half layer)", "loc": 644}, {"expr": "sigma(k) = sumdzc - 0.5*DZCK(K)", "ref": "standard sigma layer midpoint from cumulative DZCK", "loc": 658}, {"expr": "values(i) = factor * array1d(j)", "ref": "generic scaled copy used by all nc_write_* helpers", "loc": 1138}, {"expr": "array1d(L) = BELV_Global(L) + HP_Global(L)", "ref": "WSEL = bottom elevation + water depth, only where HP_Global(L) > HDRY @L1478", "loc": 1479}, {"expr": "utmp = 0.5*(RSSBCE_GLobal(L)*U_GLobal(L+1,K) + RSSBCW_GLobal(L)*U_GLobal(L,K))", "ref": "cell-centered u from edge-weighted face velocities (ROTA == 1 branch @L1490)", "loc": 1493}, {"expr": "vtmp = 0.5*(RSSBCN_GLobal(L)*V_GLobal(LN ,K) + RSSBCS_GLobal(L)*V_GLobal(L,K))", "ref": "cell-centered v, LN = LNC_GLobal(L) @L1491", "loc": 1494}, {"expr": "array3d(L, k, 1) = CUE_Global(L)*utmp + CVE_Global(L)*vtmp", "ref": "rotation to east velocity component", "loc": 1495}, {"expr": "array3d(L, k, 2) = CUN_Global(L)*utmp + CVN_Global(L)*vtmp", "ref": "rotation to north velocity component", "loc": 1496}, {"expr": "array1d(L) = SHEAR_Global(L)*RHOW(L,KSZ_Global(L))", "ref": "total bed shear stress conversion m2/s2 to Pa (comment on same line)", "loc": 1529}, {"expr": "SHEAR = 0.5*SQRT(SHEAR)", "ref": "current-only bed shear magnitude from TBX/TBY sum of squares @L1547-L1548", "loc": 1549}, {"expr": "tmp = 0.01*TSED_Global(K,L)/BULKDENS_Global(K,L)", "ref": "SEDZLJ bed toxics: layer thickness proxy, then /HBED @L1695 and *TOXB @L1696", "loc": 1694}], "io": [{"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "BELV", "loc": 99}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "HP", "loc": 100}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "WSEL", "loc": 101}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "U", "loc": 102}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "V", "loc": 103}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "W", "loc": 104}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "DELT", "loc": 105}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "total_shear", "loc": 106}, {"kind": "netcdf_output_var", "name": "cohesive